WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.572
Choose your output folder. For raw BAF, first install the reader with fun_proteomics install --baf.

00:00:11.572 --> 00:00:19.678
Drag acquisitions into conditions or use each card’s dropdown. Give technical injections the same biological sample ID so they are quantified together.

00:00:19.678 --> 00:00:25.981
Select paired comparisons when each donor contributes multiple conditions. Four conditions produce six comparisons.

00:00:25.981 --> 00:00:33.079
Enter the donor ID on every card. Technical injections do not increase the number of biological replicates.

00:00:33.079 --> 00:00:41.427
Choose a target/decoy FASTA with gene annotations and your registered search tools. Add a service matrix to benchmark detections.

00:00:41.427 --> 00:00:49.835
Check: sixteen technical injections become eight biological samples. Donor pairing is preserved for all six contrasts.

00:00:49.835 --> 00:00:57.839
Settings are saved. With real acquisitions, Run / continue starts conversion, search, LFQ and reporting. Later use --continue with this folder.

00:00:57.839 --> 00:01:03.845
This is a setup demonstration only. Placeholder files contain no spectra and are never searched.

